# ------------------------------------
# Zola Theme .gitignore
# ------------------------------------

# 1. Output Folder
# The main Zola site output directory, which is generated when a theme is used.
# This folder should never be committed to a theme repo.
public/

# 2. Theme Assets Cache
# Zola creates a cache directory for Sass compilation, minification, etc.
.zola_cache/

# 3. Zola-Specific Test Site Files (If you include a test site in the theme repo)
# If you run a test Zola site within the theme repo (e.g., in an 'example' folder)
# ignore its configuration/content files that are not part of the theme itself.

# Ignore default content/config files used for testing the theme
# Uncomment these if you are testing the theme in its own repository:
# config.toml
# content/

# 4. OS/Editor Artifacts
# Ignore files commonly generated by operating systems or code editors.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.sublime-*
.idea/
.vscode/
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
